    "body": "By Charlotte Goldstone\n2 November 2026\nIn this bonus episode of The Loadstar Podcast, we catch up with Loadstar publisher Alex Lennane, fresh from Miami, where she attended TIACA’s Air Cargo Forum (ACF).\nMs Lennane shares her key takeaways from the event, including the atmosphere on the ground, major leadership changes across the air cargo industry, and what these handovers could mean for the sector’s future. We also explore the biggest issue on delegates’ minds, with capacity emerging as a key concern, alongside some of the other talking points and industry gossip from the event.\nFrom Glyn Hughes’s final ACF as TIACA director general to the latest developments in air cargo leadership, Alex brings us up to speed on the conversations shaping the industry.\nWatch the episode on YouTube and subscribe so you never miss an update!\nClick here to receive an email notification every time we release a podcast.\nThis article is © The Loadstar. Reproduction, rewriting, or derivative use requires a license. Contact [email protected] for licensing enquiries.",
